{
  "name": "Transcribe API - webhook receiver",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Receive finished transcriptions\n1. Activate the workflow and copy the **Production URL** of the Webhook node.\n2. Paste it as the project **Webhook URL** in the dashboard (Settings tab), or send it as `webhook_url` when uploading.\n3. Copy the project **webhook secret** (`whsec_...`) into **Verify signature**.\n4. Self-hosted n8n: allow the crypto module with `NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto`.\n\nThe Webhook option **Raw Body** must stay on: the signature is an HMAC of the exact request bytes.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 660
      },
      "id": "418f3dd6-6c5f-47f6-8fb1-ddf304798981",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, -340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "transcribe-api",
        "options": {
          "rawBody": true
        }
      },
      "id": "0189f3b5-3ee7-4dd7-8804-fb403f1e4c86",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "webhookId": "8605dfc9-f9ea-480f-bbde-74b51f8ae992"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Verifies X-Transcribe-Signature = \"sha256=\" + HMAC-SHA256(raw request body, project webhook secret).\n// Needs the Webhook option \"Raw Body\": the exact request bytes arrive in binary property \"data\".\nconst crypto = require('crypto');\nconst WEBHOOK_SECRET = 'whsec_REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_PROJECT_SECRET'; // dashboard > project > Settings\n\nconst results = [];\nconst items = $input.all();\nfor (let index = 0; index < items.length; index++) {\n  const item = items[index];\n  if (!item.binary || !item.binary.data) {\n    throw new Error('No raw body: enable \"Raw Body\" in the Webhook node options');\n  }\n  const raw = await this.helpers.getBinaryDataBuffer(index, 'data');\n  const received = String(item.json.headers['x-transcribe-signature'] || '');\n  const expected = 'sha256=' + crypto.createHmac('sha256', WEBHOOK_SECRET).update(raw).digest('hex');\n  const valid = received.length === expected.length &&\n    crypto.timingSafeEqual(Buffer.from(received), Buffer.from(expected));\n  if (!valid) {\n    throw new Error('Invalid X-Transcribe-Signature: this request was not signed with your webhook secret');\n  }\n\n  const payload = JSON.parse(raw.toString('utf8'));\n  results.push({\n    json: { event: payload.event, delivered_at: payload.created_at, ...payload.data },\n    pairedItem: { item: index },\n  });\n}\nreturn results;\n"
      },
      "id": "4e25c6b0-b3a8-427e-a735-7180e292447e",
